Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:19.21,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}追いかけてた  遙か遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:24.76,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}ゆずれない思いも連れて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:35.86,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}誰も知らない頂を目指していく  全て懸けて
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.44,0:02:19.65,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}就在這裡  脫胎換骨
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.86,0:02:25.12,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}超越昨天仰望過的天際
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.37,0:02:36.25,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}手掌裡攥緊的就是希望
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.51,0:02:45.60,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}已然發現眼前的風景
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.93,0:02:50.64,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}其實全都不值一提
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.19,0:02:55.86,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}只要能遇見你
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.11,0:03:00.49,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}世界也可以輕易顛覆
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.49,0:03:07.41,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}前路充滿未知  只需要笑臉相迎
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.66,0:03:13.71,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}就還能走得很長很長
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.08,0:03:19.21,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}在遙遠的地方  已然追上你的腳步
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.55,0:03:24.76,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}心中的思緒不可撼動
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.97,0:03:35.86,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}追求無人知曉的頂點  竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:19.65,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}就在這裡  脫胎換骨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:25.12,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}超越昨天仰望過的天際
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:36.25,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}手掌裡攥緊的就是希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:45.60,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}已然發現眼前的風景
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:50.64,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}其實全都不值一提
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:55.86,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}只要能遇見你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:03:00.49,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}世界也可以輕易顛覆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:07.41,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}前路充滿未知  只需要笑臉相迎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:13.71,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}就還能走得很長很長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:19.21,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}在遙遠的地方  已然追上你的腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:24.76,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}心中的思緒不可撼動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:35.86,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}追求無人知曉的頂點  竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:55.18,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an9}あきらめちゃっていいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.31,0:23:02.48,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an9}逃げ出すことさえできなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.23,0:23:06.15,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}フラフラ、フラフラ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.65,0:23:09.95,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}自信が無くてそのせいで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:13.91,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}自分自身も出せなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:17.37,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}自信無くしてスパイラル
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:21.08,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}グルグル、グルグル
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:27.42,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}でも出逢えたから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:34.26,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}もう見失わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:37.02,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}笑顔があれば、
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:38.68,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.52,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}豪華な品も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:42.31,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}派手な飾りも、
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.44,0:23:44.02,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.23,0:23:46.07,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}食卓囲もう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.86,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}昨日のミスも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:49.70,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不安な明日も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.82,0:23:50.86,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}添えて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.24,0:23:53.37,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ねぇ、いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.53,0:23:55.24,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}凝った味付けも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.37,0:23:57.12,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}シャレた盛り付けも、
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.83,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:00.83,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}涙の味はも
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:02.62,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}しょっぱいとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.75,0:24:04.63,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最後にいつも
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:08.01,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}笑えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:11.30,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それがスパイス
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:55.18,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an9}明明放棄比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.81,0:22:59.14,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an9}明明想著不要做了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.31,0:23:02.48,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an9}但是卻連逃開也做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.23,0:23:06.15,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}搖搖晃晃  搖搖晃晃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.65,0:23:09.95,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}因為缺乏自信
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:13.91,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不會好好表達自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:17.37,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在丟失了自信的螺旋裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:21.08,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一圈一圈  一圈一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:27.42,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是已經相遇了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:34.26,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不會再弄丟了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:37.02,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只要有了笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:38.68,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.52,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}豪華的餐品也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:42.31,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}華麗的裝飾也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.44,0:23:44.02,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.23,0:23:46.07,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}餐桌上已經
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.86,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}昨天的錯誤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:49.70,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不安的明天也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.82,0:23:50.86,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}全部擺上了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.24,0:23:53.37,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}呐  多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.53,0:23:55.24,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}凝固的調料也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.37,0:23:57.12,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}精美的裝盤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.83,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:00.83,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}眼淚的味道已經
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:02.62,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就算變得鹹鹹的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.75,0:24:04.63,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最後也會一直
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:08.01,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}微笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:11.30,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這就是調味品
